blocklist.txt is assembled from disposable-email-domains
(https://github.com/disposable-email-domains/disposable-email-domains), which
is released under CC0 1.0 Universal -- a public domain dedication with no
attribution condition. It is credited here because it is the right thing to do,
not because the licence requires it.

The public suffix list this tool downloads at runtime is Mozilla's, under
MPL-2.0. It is never vendored into this repository; it is fetched into .cache/
and that file stays under its own licence.
